---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Our Business Model"
  description="How BeekeeperML stays free for home lab users and how we plan to sustain it."
>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-inner">
      <h1>Our Business Model</h1>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Free forever for home lab users</h2>
        <p>
          If you're running BeekeeperML on your own server for personal ML work, it's free.
          Not a free trial. Not a limited free tier. Just free.
        </p>
        <p>
          Home lab ML is underserved. Most tooling assumes you're either a student on a cloud
          notebook or a company with a DevOps team. BeekeeperML exists for the space in between —
          people running real hardware at home, doing real research.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>How we plan to make money</h2>
        <p>
          Through backend integrations. As BeekeeperML adds support for cloud compute providers,
          we'll earn a referral cut on compute spend that flows through the platform.
        </p>
        <p>
          These integrations are completely optional. If you only ever use your own hardware,
          you'll never pay anything. If you want to burst to cloud GPUs for a large run,
          the integration will be there — and that's where we make money.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Why we're building it this way</h2>
        <p>
          We'd rather build something the community actually uses first, and figure out the
          business second. A tool people trust is worth more than a tool people pay for once
          and abandon.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .page-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
